00:36:26.640 --> 00:36:29.780
I think that will clearly
demonstrate the value of why

00:36:29.780 --> 00:36:32.120
we invested in
these tools, so it

00:36:32.120 --> 00:36:34.790
gets me excited to
think about people

00:36:34.790 --> 00:36:38.480
actually like using the
apps we're developing,

00:36:38.480 --> 00:36:41.600
people being able
to easily access

00:36:41.600 --> 00:36:43.190
all of the different reports.

00:36:43.190 --> 00:36:45.470
Like, one of the
first projects we're

00:36:45.470 --> 00:36:49.250
planning on doing once we
get all of this really up

00:36:49.250 --> 00:36:51.560
and running and all
the deployment issues

00:36:51.560 --> 00:36:55.460
kind of like, ironed out, is
building a central landing

00:36:55.460 --> 00:36:59.630
page, like from the Posit,
like curating your data science

00:36:59.630 --> 00:37:02.510
content or content with the--

00:37:02.510 --> 00:37:07.730
what's it? --the Connect Widgets
package, which I'm so excited--

00:37:07.730 --> 00:37:10.880
I get really excited
about getting people

00:37:10.880 --> 00:37:16.260
to be able to share their work
more broadly, more seamlessly.

00:37:16.260 --> 00:37:20.960
So there are so many really
