issue in two seconds,

00:56:35.720 --> 00:56:37.810
not being like "Why don't
you understand this,

00:56:37.810 --> 00:56:40.310
you don't know how to use the
command line, blah blah blah."

00:56:40.310 --> 00:56:41.840
Whatever, it doesn't matter.

00:56:41.840 --> 00:56:44.000
Just like, "Hey, we
solved a problem together.

00:56:44.000 --> 00:56:44.900
This is exciting.

00:56:44.900 --> 00:56:46.620
This was fun."

00:56:46.620 --> 00:56:49.520
And so that gets people to
want to come back and bring

00:56:49.520 --> 00:56:51.380
